WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,940
It's been two hours and my head is getting big

2
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:06,680
Ah Chi, stop for me, Prince

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:13,140
Brother-in-law, please give me a quick review

4
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:20,300
My brother was mean to me again and slapped my palms

5
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,300
Brother, don’t always force Ah Chi like this

6
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:27,260
You see, he has been suffering every day lately, even though he is happy and suffering

7
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:33,340
It's just that he deliberately asked him to be too lazy in the past two days.

8
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:37,590
Ah Chi, since you are so afraid of brother’s strict supervision

9
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:40,590
Why don't you let your brother-in-law teach you today?

10
00:00:40,590 --> 00:00:41,590
Okay, I'll listen to my sister
